## lemonade-pull.sh kokoro-v1 Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo (from Rakazo's api container through the relay)
pull kokoro-v1 200 16.0s {"model_name":"kokoro-v1","status":"success"}
load kokoro-v1 200 6.7s {"checkpoint":"mikkoph/kokoro-onnx","model_name":"kokoro-v1","recipe":"kokoro","status":"success"}
pull Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo 200 77.4s {"model_name":"Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo","status":"success"}
load Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo 200 7.0s {"checkpoint":"ggerganov/whisper.cpp:ggml-large-v3-turbo.bin","model_name":"Whisper-Large-v3-Turbo","recipe":"whispercpp","status":"success"}

## voice-roundtrip.sh with Lemonade defaults
relay POST /audio/speech: 200 wav,3.300000
ffmpeg WebM: opus "matroska,webm",3.308000
relay POST /audio/transcriptions (WebM): 500 {"error":{"message":"Transcription failed: whisper-server returned status 400: Invalid request","type":"audio_processing_error"}}
direct GET lemonade:13305/api/v1/models, no key: 401
direct POST lemonade:13305/api/v1/audio/speech, no key: 401
direct GET lemonade:13305/api/v1/models, wrong key: 401
relay GET /models: 200

## `lemonade config set whispercpp.cpu_args=--convert` changes nothing: backend auto picks vulkan
(WhisperServer) Per-model settings: whispercpp_backend=vulkan, whispercpp_args=(none), merge_args=true, ...
(ServerProcess) Started /opt/lemonade/.cache/lemonade/bin/whispercpp/vulkan/whisper-server
(same 500 as above)

## dc.sh exec -T lemonade lemonade config set whispercpp.cpu_args= whispercpp.args=--convert; unload; load
  whispercpp.args                           --convert
  whispercpp.backend                        auto
(WhisperServer) Per-model settings: whispercpp_backend=vulkan, whispercpp_args=--convert, merge_args=true, ...
(written to /opt/lemonade/.config/lemonade/config.json, i.e. the lemonade-config volume)

